I hope you're well.

I've restarted testing today after being away for a long weekend.

[cid:image010.png@01DD1EAB.E3349D60]

First test I started,  the calculation of the gross tonnage incorrectly (se=
e below) it should have been in the region of 15850t
[cid:image001.png@01DD1E9A.507DC700]



Pallet 11 had a battery made up of 2 types of cells. I split them out



The client recorded this on the collection request
[cid:image007.png@01DD1E9A.F2271F70]

I changed it to this to get it to upload (loose cells)

[cid:image008.png@01DD1E9B.800B95F0]

This works and we can ensure clients are aware of how to record mixed batte=
ries in future.

I tried to submit but -----got this error message - as discussed previously=
, if it is other or left blank by the client, or unknow or N/A then this is=
 fine, but behind the scenes it should simply take  the TAB values.

[cid:image009.png@01DD1E9B.800B95F0]


I have saved as a draft as I'm unable to submit.  Something has gone wrong =
between (9) of the csv upload sheet and the previous ones as I was able to =
get much further.

Looking forward to hearing from you.

Kind regards
Ingrid

